       01 PC-TEXT-TABLE REDEFINES PC-TEXT-DATA GLOBAL.
          05 PC-TEXT-ROW     OCCURS 35.
             10 PC-TEXT      PIC X(90) OCCURS 6.
      *>   The texts in the current language, by name.
       01 PC-TEXTS-NOW       GLOBAL.
          05 T-KB-FOLDER-SAVED PIC X(90).
          05 T-PICK-MODEL-FIRST PIC X(90).
          05 T-TYPE-AGENT PIC X(90).
          05 T-AGENT-USES PIC X(90).
